'The recipe preserves KMnO4/H2SO4 then 35% HCl then 10% HF, extensive distilled-water wash, 150 °C precursor drying, CdO/TDPA/TOPO mixing, 320 °C argon heating, 300 °C Te/TOP injection and 250 °C/20 min growth. Workup preserves cooling to 50 °C, 5 mL initial toluene, methanol precipitation, 0.2 µm PTFE filtration, free-particle removal with toluene, and final drying with unknown conditions. The purified composite and washings are distinct outputs.',
'All microscopy scale bars, acquisition voltages, XPS pass energies/steps/base pressure, XRD wavelength, optical path length, Raman aperture/excitation/power and source absence of SAED/CIF/refinement were checked. Analytical supports and vacuum conditions do not become synthesis feeds or conditions. Long-axis 1–9 nm and aspect-ratio 1–5 ranges remain unpaired source ranges. Figure 3a inset is explicitly another composite.',
